WEBVTT

NOTE This film is an ambient origin documentary with instrumental music and
NOTE environmental sound. There is no spoken dialogue, so these captions
NOTE describe the non-speech audio content.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
[Instrumental music. Ambient roastery sounds: drum roaster turning, beans tumbling.]

00:00:12.000 --> 00:01:05.000
[Music continues. Birdsong and wind across the Matagalpa highlands.]

00:01:05.000 --> 00:02:10.000
[Music swells. Hands sorting coffee cherries; a woven basket set down.]

00:02:10.000 --> 00:03:05.000
[Music softens. Roastery ambience: cooling tray stirring, beans poured into a canister.]

00:03:05.000 --> 00:04:18.000
[Music resolves. Ambient sound fades.]
